<h2 id="surrealdb-health-check">SurrealDB Health Check</h2>
<p>This health check verifies the ability to communicate with <a href="https://surrealdb.com">SurrealDb</a>. It uses the provided <a href="https://surrealdb.com/docs/sdk/dotnet">ISurrealDbClient</a>.</p>
<h3 id="defaults">Defaults</h3>
<p>By default, the <code>ISurrealDbClient</code> instance is resolved from service provider.</p>
<pre><code class="language-csharp">void Configure(IHealthChecksBuilder builder)
{
    builder.Services.AddSurreal(&quot;Server=http://localhost:8000;Namespace=test;Database=test&quot;);
    builder.AddHealthChecks().AddSurreal();
}
</code></pre>
